Linux kernel for s5p6818
============
Hardware: nanopc_t3 plus
Linux kernel: linux-5.10.252
Compiler: gcc-linaro-12.1.1-2022.08-x86_64_aarch64-linux-gnu

build: ./s5p6818.sh

There are still many problems: 
1.The power module is not working, and I haven't found its driver. It use a stm32 IC.
2.The GPU driver has not been ported.


